{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45537","headline":"宿九华化成寺庄 · 泠然","name":"宿九华化成寺庄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"佛寺孤庄千嶂间，我来诗境强相关。\n岩边树动猿下涧，云里锡鸣僧上山。\n松月影寒生碧落，石泉声乱喷潺湲。\n明朝更蹑层霄去，誓共烟霞到老闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"泠然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45537.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45537","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}